**One honest caveat on line items:** the current model extracts the header-level fields listed above, but not individual line items (description, quantity, unit price per row). Line items are a table structure that requires a separate table extraction field group in IxP. If you need those, that's a follow-on piece of work — happy to add it. For most SAP invoice posting workflows the header fields are what's needed for the initial booking.

